      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This talk will briefly examine the development process used by the PostgreSQL project over the last year, and take a look back at the new features that have been committed to the source tree for the upcoming 9.0 release, as well as some of those currently in development.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </abstract>
